# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Lumora is a client-routed SPA: /app/chat/<id> exists only in the browser's
# router, so a direct visit or a refresh on that URL asks the CDN for a file
# that was never built. Without this the user gets a 404 on every deep link
# and on every page reload — the two things people do most with a chat URL.
#
# 200, not 301: the browser keeps the original path so the router can read it.
/*    /index.html   200
